WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,110
Yikes, I've just heard about people using their old-aged urine to get lots of stem cells

00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:22,430
into their bodies, both by drinking and animals. Have you ever heard this? Yes, I have.

00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:29,750
But understand you don't want extra stem cells or you don't want stem cell stimulators

00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:37,310
in your body if you have cancer, because stem cells are premature cells that can differentiate

00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:43,470
into something that you don't want it to differentiate into. If you have cancer and

00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:52,510
could differentiate into a cancer cell, so you want to try drinking your own urine

00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:58,920
that's up to you that time. I would do some more research on that.

